"version": "1",
"text": "You are dressed for a relaxed morning yoga session in a comfortable graphite t-shirt that gives your shoulders and arms total freedom of movement. Over this, you wear a stylish black-and-white checked wool coat with a belt to cinch the waist, creating a defined silhouette that complements your figure perfectly. Your legs are covered by light blue jeans finished with rolled cuffs at the hem, adding a casual yet deliberate touch to your look. To complete the ensemble, you have chosen bright yellow loafers, which inject a cheerful pop of color against the neutral base. As an accessory, a silvery-colored earring set adds a subtle metallic gleam without overwhelming the natural simplicity of the scene.",
"how_to_wear": "Start with the grey t-shirt tucked loosely into the jeans for comfort during your practice; later in the day you can unbutton it or wear it open over the coat if temperatures drop.",
