"about_items": [
{
"n": "#160·14",
"text": "These yellow loafers feature a sleek, low-cut leather upper with a classic strap across the instep for easy wear. The smooth finish contrasts gently against your black coat while the compact heel ensures stability during yoga poses."
},
{
"n": "#219·31",
"text": "These small silvery earrings carry a modern knot motif that adds delicate shine without distracting from the natural textures of your wool and denim. The cool metallic tone harmonizes beautifully with both your graphite top and the earthy tones in the room."
},
{
"n": "#114·04",
"text": "This oversized plaid coat offers generous warmth for a brisk morning, its black-and-white check pattern creating visual rhythm that plays well against your light blue jeans. The included belt defines your waistline precisely, giving structure to the voluminous shape."
},
{
"n": "#319·06",
"text": "These light blue jeans are tailored with a straight leg and finished cuffs rolled up at the bottom to highlight your ankles—a small detail that keeps movement fluid during stretching. The medium wash adds depth without overpowering your soft t-shirt."
},
{
"n": "#24·35",
"text": "This graphite t-shirt drapes softly around your frame with a slightly dropped shoulder line, letting you move freely without restriction. Its neutral tone serves as the perfect foundation for layered styling and allows your coat to stand out when worn together."
},
{
"n": "#21·20",
"text": "This mint-green woven bag brings an organic texture and a fresh color note that complements your yellow loafers. Its slouchy shape fits naturally beside you during practice, carrying essentials without bulk or fuss."
}
]
